    "title": "Annual Christmas in the Park Drive-Thru Light Show Returns to Arnette Park Starting December 7 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "2 hours ago Fayetteville-Cumberland Parks and Recreation will hold its annual drive-thru light show, Christmas in the Park, starting Sunday, December 7, 2025. The event takes place at Arnette Park, 2165 Wilmington Highway. Visitors can view light displays across 100 acres near the Cape Fear River. The lights are provided by Fayetteville PWC.\nThe event is free and open from 6 to 9 p.m. on December 7–11, 14–18, and 21–22, except Fridays and Saturdays. For more information, call (910) 433-1547 or visit FCPR.us.\nVisit here for more details This post includes content assisted by AI tools. Please refer to the source for verification and additional information. Learn more.\n1",
